---

Data: The VirginTrains corpus (27,817 outbound / 37,444 inbound pool) is derived
from Kaggle "Customer Support on Twitter" (TWCS, 2,811,774 rows) under
CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/thoughtvector/customer-support-on-twitter).
No separate data redistribution beyond the derived processed files in
data/processed/ and data/indexes/ is intended. The raw TWCS dump
(data/raw/twcs.csv) is gitignored and not shipped.
